      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "On the basis of the statements so recorded, learned Magistrate has submitted MoT 42 13:03 Teport dated 03.12.2025 to the effect that the compromise has been effected MOHIT 2025.12.12 13:03 2025 PRUE: Hee CRM-M-65775-2025 (O&M) -2- between the parties voluntarily and without any coercion or undue influence.",
