      "start": 1945,
      "end": 2079,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Following the principles laid down by the Full Bench judgment of this Court in Kulwinder Singh and others Versus State of Punjab and another 2007 (3) RCR (Criminal) 1052 and approved by the Hon'ble Supreme Court in Gian Singh Versus State of Punjab and others (2012) 10 SCC 303, this petition is allowed and FIR No. 0083 dated 04.06.2025 registered at Police Station Habowal,\nDistrict Police Commissionerate Ludhiana (Annexure P-1) and all subsequent proceedings arising therefrom on the basis of compromise/settlement dated 03.11.2025 (Annexure P-2) are quashed.\n7. Pending miscellaneous application(s), if any, stand(s) disposed of, accordingly.",
